WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:03.062
The baseball sailed toward Glen.

2
00:00:03.063 --> 00:00:05.599
He looked up and opened his glove.

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.974
Glen leaned back as the ball flew over his head.

4
00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:13.174
But he fell backward, and the ball landed in the grass behind him.

5
00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:15.976
Glen jumped up and grabbed the ball.

6
00:00:15.977 --> 00:00:20.277
He threw it to the infield, but it was too late.

7
00:00:20.278 --> 00:00:22.609
Huck had scored.

8
00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:26.257
Wes Wheezer stood on the ledge of the big scoreboard.

9
00:00:26.258 --> 00:00:29.086
He added a run for Huck's team.

10
00:00:29.087 --> 00:00:32.447
Then he added an error for Glen's team.

11
00:00:32.448 --> 00:00:39.502
Glen let out a sigh. "I almost had that one," he said to Ivy.

12
00:00:39.503 --> 00:00:47.152
Ivy rolled her eyes. "Yeah, too bad almost doesn't count!"

13
00:00:47.153 --> 00:00:52.029
*** At last the game ended. Ivy and Glen's team had

14
00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:55.597
lost. The players of both teams lined up on the

15
00:00:55.598 --> 00:00:59.043
field. They walked past each other and slapped

16
00:00:59.044 --> 00:01:02.945
hands. "Good game, good game," everyone

17
00:01:02.946 --> 00:01:08.860
said. Huck and Glen slapped hands. "Good game—loser!" Huck

18
00:01:08.861 --> 00:01:13.925
said. Ivy and Glen watched as the Ucks laughed and high-fived each

19
00:01:13.926 --> 00:01:19.538
other. Ivy turned to Glen. "Now do you want to get back at those guys?" she

20
00:01:19.539 --> 00:01:23.390
whispered. Glen nodded.

21
00:01:23.391 --> 00:01:26.894
"Definitely." They looked for Ezra as they walked off the

22
00:01:26.895 --> 00:01:29.822
field. But they couldn't find him

23
00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:32.751
anywhere. Ivy spotted Willow and

24
00:01:32.752 --> 00:01:36.246
Clara. "Hey, have you guys seen Ezra?" she

25
00:01:36.247 --> 00:01:40.447
called. "He was walking toward the hiking trails," Willow

26
00:01:40.448 --> 00:01:45.145
said. Clara nodded. "He looked kind of

27
00:01:45.146 --> 00:01:50.495
upset." "Uh-oh," Ivy said. "Glen, we have to find

28
00:01:50.496 --> 00:01:53.778
him." Glen and Ivy went to the

29
00:01:53.779 --> 00:02:00.552
woods. "Ezra! Hey, Ezra!" Ivy yelled as they headed down a hiking

30
00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:07.280
trail. "Ezra, where are you?" Glen yelled. They kept

31
00:02:07.281 --> 00:02:11.519
walking. Finally they found him sitting alone on a

32
00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:17.970
log. "Whew, there you are!" Ivy said. "We were worried about

33
00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:22.887
you." Ezra looked up. "I just had to get away from everyone.

34
00:02:22.888 --> 00:02:26.373
At least I got to talk to my parents today.

35
00:02:26.374 --> 00:02:31.743
They promised to take me to the Museum of Technology after camp ends."

36
00:02:31.744 --> 00:02:36.743
"That's not a beach vacation at a fancy resort," Glen said.

37
00:02:36.744 --> 00:02:39.153
"But I guess it's cool."

38
00:02:39.154 --> 00:02:46.132
"Yes, it is, but what about my new nickname?" Ezra shook his head.

39
00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:51.841
"I'll be called Snuggy Wuggy for the rest of my life!"

40
00:02:51.842 --> 00:02:57.452
"No, you won't," Glen said. "It'll only be for the rest of camp."

41
00:02:57.453 --> 00:03:00.830
Ivy and Glen sat beside him on the log.

42
00:03:00.831 --> 00:03:06.001
"Listen, we're going to find a way to prank the Ucks," Ivy said.

43
00:03:06.002 --> 00:03:08.701
"We'll make them stop teasing you."

44
00:03:08.702 --> 00:03:13.698
Ezra sat up straighter. "Really? How?"

45
00:03:13.699 --> 00:03:18.761
"We don't know yet, but we'll think of something," Ivy said.

46
00:03:18.762 --> 00:03:23.201
She took the candy out of her pockets and passed some to the boys.

47
00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:27.524
The three sat there, thinking as they ate their candy.

48
00:03:27.525 --> 00:03:31.430
"Pranks are a big thing at camp," Glen said.

49
00:03:31.431 --> 00:03:39.121
"Last year somebody had their underwear stolen, and it was hung from the flagpole!" He chuckled.

50
00:03:39.122 --> 00:03:43.333
Ezra looked at him. "Wasn't that you?"

51
00:03:43.334 --> 00:03:46.503
Glen shrugged and didn't answer.

52
00:03:46.504 --> 00:03:50.112
A few minutes later, they heard a bugle call.

53
00:03:50.113 --> 00:03:54.593
"Time for lunch," Glen said. "We should get going."

54
00:03:54.594 --> 00:03:58.120
"Do we have to?" Ezra said.

55
00:03:58.121 --> 00:04:03.343
Ivy nodded. "Unfortunately, yes."

56
00:04:03.344 --> 00:04:07.933
They started back toward the lodge.

57
00:04:07.934 --> 00:04:12.744
"Ezra, maybe you could build something to scare the Ucks," Glen said.

58
00:04:12.745 --> 00:04:15.343
"Like what?" Ezra asked.

59
00:04:15.344 --> 00:04:19.851
"I don't know, but try to think of something," Glen said.

60
00:04:19.852 --> 00:04:23.490
Suddenly they heard a chattering sound behind them.

61
00:04:23.491 --> 00:04:26.639
They all turned to see what the noise was.

62
00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:30.554
There, beside the log, was a raccoon!

63
00:04:30.555 --> 00:04:33.883
It held a piece of candy in its paws.

